        "original_id": "f9987ce0-a125-57e2-93b5-aba4422fb1a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Splash!\n- People: Tom Daley\n- Topics: Diving, 10-metre platform\n\nFacts:\n- Splash! is a British television show that teaches celebrities the art of diving.\n- Tom Daley aids celebrities on Splash! by teaching diving.\n- Tom Daley specialises in the 10-metre platform event.\n- Tom Daley won the 2009 FINA World Championship individual title in the 10-metre platform event at age 15.\n- Tom Daley was the 2012 Olympic bronze medalist in the 10-metre platform event.\n- Tom Daley regained the World Championship in the 10-metre platform event in 2017, making him a double World champion in the event.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
